Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:03.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,You win seven out of ten\Ntrades. A {\c&H1EB0F2&}seventy{\c&HFAF7F5&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.83,0:00:07.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,percent win rate. Your\Naccount is still going
