Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.55,0:00:45.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,Each win was plus zero\Npoint three R. Each
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,loss, minus one R.\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}Average{\c&HFAF7F5&} R, minus zero
